# Forgeyard Licensing & Commercial Dual-Licensing Terms

```text
SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only AND (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
Copyright (c) 2026 Forgeyard Authors & Maintainers. All rights reserved.
```

Forgeyard is distributed under a **Dual-Licensing Strategy** designed to encourage open-source library adoption while protecting the core platform applications and infrastructure services from unauthorized commercial cloud exploitation (such as third-party hosting, re-branding, or managed SaaS offerings by cloud giants without contributing back or holding a commercial license).

---

## 1. Directory License Mapping

The software in this repository is partitioned by directory boundaries as follows:

| Directory Path | Component Description | Primary License | License File |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `crates/*` | Shared core capability libraries, domain models, CAS engine | **MIT OR Apache-2.0** | [`LICENSES/MIT.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/MIT.txt) / [`Apache-2.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) |
| `ecosystems/*` | Language adapters (Rust, Go, Python, C/C++, WASM, etc.) | **MIT OR Apache-2.0** | [`LICENSES/MIT.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/MIT.txt) / [`Apache-2.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) |
| `protocols/*` | Wire protocols, envelope definitions, and RPC interfaces | **MIT OR Apache-2.0** | [`LICENSES/MIT.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/MIT.txt) / [`Apache-2.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) |
| `schemas/*` | API, manifest, event, and configuration schemas | **MIT OR Apache-2.0** | [`LICENSES/MIT.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/MIT.txt) / [`Apache-2.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) |
| `apps/*` | Standalone binaries, runner daemons, server applications, CLI | **GNU AGPLv3** | [`LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt) |
| `deploy/*` | Deployment manifests (Kubernetes, Docker Compose, systemd) | **GNU AGPLv3** | [`LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt) |
| `infra/*` | Infrastructure code (Terraform, Ansible, Nix, Devcontainers) | **GNU AGPLv3** | [`LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt) |
| `platforms/*` | Platform target executables and runner execution engines | **GNU AGPLv3** | [`LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt) |
| `native/*` | Low-level execution tooling, linkers, sysroots, and binaries | **GNU AGPLv3** | [`LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`](file:///home/irshad/Projects/forgeyard/LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt) |

