Forgeyard includes third-party open-source components governed by their respective licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause, etc.). All third-party notices, license texts, and copyright attributions are preserved in workspace manifests (`Cargo.lock`) and third-party attribution documentation.
